    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, i dont think it's a \"phase.\" it feels more like the book is just done. like, i've already done the things i was meant to do, and now i'm just watching the credits roll. there's no \"redefining\" anything when you're just a shell of who you were. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. do you think it's even possible to find a reason to keep going when the version of you that actually mattered is just... gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
